<p>While some tools specialize in data collection, others are more in tune with performing data cleaning and transformation. Therefore, often, you have to deal with multiple data processing tools. The data processing tools can be divided into data collection, cleaning, transformation, and analysis. Common tools involved in data processing are the following:</p>
