<li>BI Tools – Tableau, Power BI, Qlik View</li>
</ol>
<ul>
<li>
<h3><strong>Data Warehousing</strong></h3>
</li>
</ul>
<ol>
<li>Database Management Systems (DBMS) – relational database design, SQL queries, etc.</li>
<li>NoSQL databases – MongoDB, Redis, Cassandra</li>
<li>Data Pipelines – ETL, ELT processes</li>
<li>Knowledge of various data collection and storage techniques</li>
</ol>
