<h3><strong>What Boosts Your Salary?</strong></h3>
<p>Certain skills carry a measurable premium. Machine learning proficiency adds roughly 35% above baseline. Cloud platform skills (AWS, Azure, GCP) add about 31%. Python expertise over SQL-only profiles adds 1.5 to 2.5 LPA at equivalent experience levels. Investing in these skills directly impacts what you earn.</p>
